sequenceDiagram
    participant Seller as Seller API
    participant UC as CreateProduct UseCase
    participant AttrUC as LoadCategoryAttributes UseCase
    participant Gen as DescriptionGenerator
    participant Score as QualityScorePolicy
    participant Repo as ProductRepository
    participant Bus as EventBus

    Seller->>AttrUC: loadCategoryAttributes(categoryId)
    AttrUC-->>Seller: CategoryAttributeSchema[]

    Seller->>UC: createProduct(StructuredCreateProductDto)
    
    UC->>UC: Validate structuredAttributes against schema
    UC->>Gen: generateDescription(attributes, template)
    Gen-->>UC: GeneratedProductDescription
    
    UC->>UC: generateSeoTitle(brand, productName, keyAttribute)
    UC->>UC: generateSlug(categorySlug, brand, productName, keyAttribute)
    
    UC->>Score: computeQualityScore(product)
    Score-->>UC: QualityScore (0–100)
    
    UC->>UC: rejectIfScoreBelow(60)
    
    UC->>Repo: saveWithAttributesTransaction(product, attributes)
    Repo-->>UC: Product saved
    
    UC->>Bus: publish(ProductCreatedWithStructuredDataEvent)
    Bus-->>UC: Event published
    
    UC-->>Seller: ProductResponseDto {productId, qualityScore, slug}
